/textArea><textArea id="10-media_text1" x="820" y="680" width="472" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">2. Object-created event + asset version</textArea><textArea id="10-media_text2" x="1332" y="1064" width="472" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">4. Create bounded image/video derivatives</textArea><textArea id="10-media_text3" x="820" y="1256" width="984" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">5. Write derivatives to separate output prefix</textArea><textArea id="10-media_text4" x="1332" y="1448" width="472" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">6. Completion / failure event</textArea><textArea id="10-media_text5" x="1332" y="1640" width="984" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">7. Record ready variants; still unpublished</textArea><textArea id="10-media_text6" x="308" y="1832" width="2008" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">8. Review branding, labels, video; approve version</textArea><textArea id="10-media_text7" x="2356" y="2024" width="472" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">9. Publish immutable URLs + dimensions + alt text</textArea><textArea id="10-media_text8" x="820" y="2216" width="2008" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">10. Fetch approved derivative through origin access</textArea><textArea id="10-media_text9" x="64" y="3520" width="3072" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" fill="#595959">Generated packaging is a mockup until approved. No processing loop: source and derivative prefixes differ. Only public product media is CDN-readable; invoices, imports and customer data remain private.</textArea></g></svg>